1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Focus Agent keeps Raj's current priority visible.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:13,500
Built for Raj. Private by design.
Personal activity stays on the computer.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:27,000
One dashboard shows intention, activity,
confidence, and essential statistics.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Pause monitoring from 15 minutes to 4 hours,
or until Raj chooses to resume.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Raj stays in control.
Monitoring resumes only when requested.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Natural-language goals become priorities
using local Gemma through Ollama.

7
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:12,000
As the day changes, Raj can switch
the active priority instantly.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Progress is confirmed by Raj—not guessed
from time spent in an application.

9
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:34,500
“Still related” teaches Focus Agent
the correct task-and-app relationship.

10
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:40,500
Interventions begin with a gentle focus check.

11
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:46,000
Repeated ignored drift makes the next check stronger.

12
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:58,000
The full intervention shows the priority,
activity, duration, and daily statistics.

13
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Gemma's reasoning is inspectable.
Deterministic policy controls every interruption.

14
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Choose: return, correct, take a break,
switch tasks, or pause monitoring.

15
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:20,700
Open-weight AI at the core.
Private, local, and always user-controlled.
